  "description": "This bright and well-presented one-bedroom third-floor apartment is ideally positioned within the popular Marketpoint development in the heart of Mullingar. Freshly painted and maintained in very good condition throughout, the property offers comfortable, low-maintenance accommodation within walking distance of the town centre and train station, making it an attractive option for first-time buyers, commuters or investors.\n\nThe accommodation comprises an entrance hall with timber flooring and useful separate storage. The bright open-plan kitchen and living area features a fully fitted kitchen with integrated electric oven and hob, plumbing for a washing machine and a comfortable living space with an electric fireplace. A door leads to the balcony, which enjoys elevated views across Mullingar, including the canal and surrounding townscape.\n\nThe spacious double bedroom is finished with timber flooring and also benefits from an elevated outlook across the town. The accommodation is completed by a well-appointed bathroom with bath and shower, WC and wash hand basin.\n\nMarketpoint is a mature and conveniently located development with excellent management in place. Mullingar town centre and the train station are approximately a five-minute walk away, while Tesco, Lidl, Fairgreen Shopping Centre, schools, restaurants, cafés, hotels and leisure facilities are all within easy reach. The nearby road network also provides convenient access to the C-Link Road and onward connections.\n\nThis apartment represents an ideal starter or investment property and viewing is highly recommended.\n\nAccommodation\nEntrance Hall \t1.11m x 3.34m (3'8\" x 10'11\"): \nTimber flooring.\n\nStorage Room \t0.62m x 2.04m (2' x 6'8\"): \nTimber flooring.\n\nBathroom \t2.24m x 2.02m (7'4\" x 6'8\"): \nBath with shower, WC, wash hand basin, shaving mirror and light, large wall mounted mirror, tiled floor, tiled wall.\n\nBedroom \t3.04m x 3.62m (10' x 11'11\"): \nTimber flooring, nice view of town, electric storage heater.\n\nKitchen/Living Area \n2.32m x 2.12m (7'7\" x 6'11\") & \n4.82m x 3.47m (15'10\" x 11'5\"): Timber flooring, fitted kitchen, integrated electric oven and hob, plumbed for washing machine, electric storage heating, electric fireplace, balcony.\n\nSpecial Features & Services\n•\tBright one-bedroom third-floor apartment\n•\tPresented in very good condition throughout\n•\tFreshly painted\n•\tPrivate balcony with elevated views towards the town, canal and surrounding area\n•\tBright open-plan kitchen and living area\n•\tFully fitted kitchen with integrated electric oven and hob\n•\tElectric fireplace\n•\tElectric storage heating\n•\tUseful separate storage room\n•\tApproximately five minutes' walk from Mullingar town centre\n•\tApproximately five minutes' walk from Mullingar train station\n•\tClose to Tesco, Lidl and Fairgreen Shopping Centre\n•\tWalking distance of shops, restaurants, cafés and leisure amenities\n•\tExcellent management in place\n•\tIdeal first-time buyer or investment opportunity\n•\tPrime central location\n\nIncluded\n•\tFixtures and fittings\n•\tOven/hob\n•\tLight fittings\n•\tFridge freezer\n•\tWashing machine",
